---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="关于我 · chenqian-ctk" description="关于 chenqian-ctk">
  <div class="prose">
    <span class="eyebrow">// about</span>
    <h1>关于我</h1>
    <p>你好，我是 chenqian-ctk，目前在学习 AI / Agent 方向，正在寻找相关实习机会。</p>
    <p>我习惯边学边动手：把每个知识点都做成能跑起来的小项目，再写成文章沉淀下来。这个博客就是我的学习轨迹。</p>

    <h2>项目</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/chenqian-ctk/langchain-rag-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">langchain-rag-demo</a>
        — LangChain 入门：本地文档问答（RAG）
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/chenqian-ctk/langgraph-agent-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">langgraph-agent-demo</a>
        — LangGraph 入门：带工具的 Agent
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>技术栈</h2>
    <div class="skills">
      <span class="skill">Python</span>
      <span class="skill">LangChain</span>
      <span class="skill">LangGraph</span>
      <span class="skill">RAG</span>
      <span class="skill">LLM</span>
      <span class="skill">Astro</span>
      <span class="skill">Git</span>
    </div>

    <h2>联系方式</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>GitHub：<a href="https://github.com/chenqian-ctk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">chenqian-ctk</a></li>
      <li>博客：<a href="/">chenqian-ctk.github.io</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
